  <h2 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-signal-700">Portable</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-slate-700">Portable APRS stations are typically dual-band handheld radios paired with an integrated or external GPS. As you move up in capability, GPS becomes built in and the radio gets more full-featured.</p>
